# Exact Measure on a DPR-3 phone held sideways (the quick actions a right-hand column): cleared in exactly as many taps
# as cubes by keys, then the results; a timed challenge's clock in the HUD, paused by the tray's Pause.
# viewport 844x390@3
frames 90
touch =All modes
frames 20
touch Challenge
frames 20
touch =Exact Measure
frames 60
key Enter 1
frames 10
repeat 4000 until Board cleared
key Enter 1
frames 6
end
frames 120
expect Board cleared
save c-results
touch =Modes
frames 20
touch Challenge
frames 20
